events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T19:07:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T22:19:16Z","body":"> I've tidied this up a bit, but it will require another round of testing @elvisish .\r\n> \r\n> I've tried to make the whole project setting override futureproof, so we can replace the technique with NVAPI in the future (and use the same project setting), or just copy that part across to an NVAPI PR, if we decide to go that route.\r\n\r\nEDIT: works perfectly turning the new setting on:\r\n<img width=\"859\" height=\"115\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3910618a-b62b-4f37-baa3-ea1a33864637\" />\r\nI can confirm this works as intended and should definatly be approved by review.\r\n\r\nTested with this:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/suites/78306755530/artifacts/8174774723","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4918320667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4918590495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106556#issuecomment-4918590495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106556","id":4918590495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJSu8Hw","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T19:43:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T05:12:31Z","body":"> Oh dear:\r\n\r\nDon't panic, is probably a small logic bug as the command line + project setting logic is a bit convoluted, and I haven't debugged through yet, will take a look tomorrow.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4918590495/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5084393114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106556#issuecomment-5084393114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106556","id":5084393114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLw2umg","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","e